    "updated_at": "2024-10-02T01:23:59Z",
    "body": "> Is the idea here that nothing should be in the top layer when a document is no longer fully active? Will we also empty it when a document becomes inactive?\r\n\r\nNo, I think the idea is that nothing should be in the top layer for synthetic documents. \"Normal\" documents that get bfcached can have a top layer without an issue, IMO.",
